     $supplier         sells the compounds, owns $club (4.12)
     $bestFriend       the best friend of the sister from college (6.6c)
   They are not in Character Configuration (not renamable for now), but every text still uses the variables.
   Their companies are in Define Misc ($marketingFirm, $gymChain, $retailChain, $club). */
